---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Provisional Patent Draft — 24-Hour Turnaround" description="We prepare a technical provisional patent draft package from your evidence. Sliding scale. 24-hour turnaround. You or your attorney files it.">

<section style="padding-top: 160px; min-height: 80vh;">
  <div class="container narrow" style="max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 5vw;">

    <div class="eyebrow">AIIT Patent Services</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 5rem); margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.1;">Your idea deserves<br>a filing date.</h1>
    <p class="pv-lede">
      We prepare a technical provisional patent draft package from your evidence in 24 hours.
      You or your attorney reviews it and files with the USPTO.
    </p>

    <!-- HERO IMAGE -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 32px; margin-left: -5vw; margin-right: -5vw; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(212,164,55,0.2);">
      <img src="/provisional/patent-hero.png" alt="AIIT Patent Services — Your idea deserves a filing date" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;" loading="eager" />
    </div>

    <!-- BOUNDARY — UP FRONT -->
    <div class="pv-boundary">
      <p>This is not legal advice, attorney representation, patentability analysis, or a guarantee of protection. We prepare a technical provisional draft package and optional guided filing walkthrough for you or your attorney to review and file.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- WHAT YOU GET -->
    <div style="margin-top: 64px;">
      <div class="eyebrow">What you get</div>
      <h2 style="font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3.5vw, 2rem); margin-bottom: 24px;">A draft package ready for filing.</h2>

      <div class="pv-grid">
        <div class="pv-feat">
          <h3>Technical description</h3>
          <p>Your invention described in provisional-patent language. What it is, how it works, why it's different.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pv-feat">
          <h3>Claims outline</h3>
          <p>Structured claims drafted from your evidence. Not formal patent claims — a working outline your attorney can refine.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pv-feat">
          <h3>Figures & diagrams</h3>
          <p>Reference drawings, flowcharts, or system diagrams pulled from your materials or created from your descriptions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pv-feat">
          <h3>Evidence binder</h3>
          <p>Full ProofDesk packet included — manifest, hashes, chain of custody, sealed archive. Your proof trail is built in.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pv-feat">
          <h3>Filing guide</h3>
          <p>Step-by-step instructions for filing the provisional with the USPTO yourself, or handing it to your attorney.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pv-feat">
          <h3>24-hour turnaround</h3>
          <p>From the moment we confirm access to your materials. You wake up with a draft.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PRICING -->
    <div id="pricing" style="margin-top: 64px;">
      <div class="eyebrow">Sliding scale by situation</div>
      <h2 style="font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3.5vw, 2rem); margin-bottom: 12px;">Choose the tier that fits.</h2>
      <p class="pv-scale-note">
        We price by who you are, how urgent it is, and how much money is already behind the project.
        No proof required. Choose honestly.
      </p>
      <p class="pv-scale-hint">
        If you are protecting an idea before you have money, choose Community.<br>
        If the idea already has money behind it, choose Business.
      </p>

      <div class="pv-price-grid">
        <div class="pv-price-card">
          <div class="pv-tier-name">Community</div>
          <div class="pv-price">$499</div>
          <p>For students, low-income inventors, unfunded builders, and people trying to protect early work before they have resources.</p>
          <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/cNi28l7BM8788qtbqpew80c" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-buy pv-buy">Choose Community →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pv-price-card pv-featured">
          <div class="pv-tier-name">Independent</div>
          <div class="pv-price">$1,499</div>
          <p>For solo builders, working inventors, early founders, and small teams paying out of pocket.</p>
          <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/bJebIV2hs4UWbCFgKJew80d" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-buy pv-buy">Choose Independent →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pv-price-card">
          <div class="pv-tier-name">Business</div>
          <div class="pv-price">$3,499</div>
          <p>For companies, funded founders, agencies, attorneys, commercial launches, and urgent deadlines.</p>
          <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/6oUeV72hsbjkfSV3XXew80e" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-buy pv-buy">Choose Business →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 24px;">
        <p style="color: var(--slate); font-size: 0.85rem;">
          Rush / commercial priority? <a href="mailto:ProofDeskService@aiitcorp.com?subject=Provisional+Rush" style="color: var(--amber);">Contact us →</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
    <div style="margin-top: 64px;">
      <div class="eyebrow">How it works</div>
      <div class="pv-steps">
        <div class="pv-step">
          <div class="pv-step-num">1</div>
          <div><h3>Send your materials</h3><p>Invention notes, sketches, code, screenshots, AI outputs, prior art, anything relevant. Messy is fine.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pv-step">
          <div class="pv-step-num">2</div>
          <div><h3>We draft in 24 hours</h3><p>Technical description, claims outline, figures, evidence binder, filing guide. All sealed and hashed.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pv-step">
          <div class="pv-step-num">3</div>
          <div><h3>You review and file</h3><p>Review the draft yourself or hand it to your attorney. File with the USPTO. Your filing date is established.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- OPTIONAL ADD-ON -->
    <div style="margin-top: 64px;">
      <div class="eyebrow">Optional add-on</div>
      <div class="pv-addon">
        <h3>Guided USPTO Filing Walkthrough</h3>
        <p>We walk you through the actual filing process step by step. Screen-share or async guidance — whatever works for your situation.</p>
        <div class="pv-addon-prices">
          <span>Student / solo: $149</span>
          <span>Standard: $499</span>
          <span>Commercial / urgent: $999</span>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--slate); margin-top: 12px;">Mention the walkthrough add-on when you email your materials.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FINAL CTA -->
    <div style="margin-top: 64px; padding-bottom: 80px; text-align: center;">
      <h2 style="font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3.5vw, 2rem); margin-bottom: 12px;">Your idea deserves a date.</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--slate); margin-bottom: 24px;">Send your materials. Wake up with a draft.</p>
      <a href="mailto:ProofDeskService@aiitcorp.com?subject=Provisional+Patent+Draft" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-buy">Start your provisional →</a>
      <p style="color: var(--slate); font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 24px;">
        Questions? <a href="mailto:ProofDeskService@aiitcorp.com" style="color: var(--amber);">ProofDeskService@aiitcorp.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pv-lede {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.15rem);
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .pv-boundary {
    padding: 20px;
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.3);
    background: rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.04);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  }

  .pv-boundary p {
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .pv-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .pv-feat {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.12);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 24px 20px;
  }

  .pv-feat h3 { color: var(--cream, #E8E0D4); font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .pv-feat p { color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; }

  .pv-scale-note {
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .pv-scale-hint {
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .pv-price-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .pv-price-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.15);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 32px 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .pv-featured {
    border-color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    background: rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.06);
  }

  .pv-tier-name {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .pv-price {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    color: var(--cream, #E8E0D4);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .pv-price-card p {
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .pv-buy {
    padding: 10px 28px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .pv-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .pv-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .pv-step-num {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .pv-step h3 { color: var(--cream, #E8E0D4); font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .pv-step p { color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; }

  .pv-addon {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.12);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 28px 24px;
  }

  .pv-addon h3 { color: var(--cream, #E8E0D4); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .pv-addon p { color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; }

  .pv-addon-prices {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .pv-addon-prices span {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
  }
</style>

</Layout>
